    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/22/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "はたけに　うえて　つかう　タネ。\nうえる　はたけに　よって　できる\nにんじんの　しゅるいが　かわる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "밭에 심을 수 있는 씨.\n심은 밭에 따라\n자라는 당근의 종류가 달라진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可以種在田地裡的種子。\n長出來的蘿蔔種類會根據\n種下它的田地而不同。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Des graines à planter dans un champ. L’espèce\nde carotte obtenue varie selon le type de sol.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Samen, die sich auf einem Feld einpflanzen lassen.\nJe nachdem, wie dieses beschaffen ist, wächst dort\neine andere Karottenart.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Semillas para plantar en un huerto. Permiten obtener\nun tipo u otro de zanahoria en función del lugar elegido\npara su cultivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dei semi da piantare in un campo. La varietà di carote\nottenibili cambia in base al terreno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Seeds to plant in a field. The kind of carrot you’ll get is\ndetermined by which field you plant the seeds in.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "畑に　植えて　使う　タネ。\n植える　畑に　よって　できる\nにんじんの　種類が　変わる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "种在田地里使用的种子。\n出产的萝卜种类会根据\n种下的田地而有所不同。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Semillas para plantar en un huerto. Permiten obtener\nun tipo u otro de zanahoria en función del lugar elegido\npara su cultivo.",
      "version_group": {
